Error [E0367]: Pattern `Circle` needs a leading `.`
  --> tests/ui/optional_comparison_bare_variant.jet:8:9
    |
  8 |         Circle(radius) -> print(radius)
    |         ^^^^^^
 Why: Match patterns take a leading dot so the name isn't read as a variable or call
 Fix: Write `.Circle(…)`
